  "description": "1.优化CusResponseMessage字段排序\n2.优化CusResponseMessage的Error方法\n3.新增CusResponseJsonResult的Success和Error方法\n4.优化CusResponseStatusCode枚举\n5.修改FeigeSms短信接口，新增HttpClientHelper类\n6.修改DateHelper帮助类，新增日期转中文大写方法\n7.更新HttpClientHelper类\n8.添加CusRequest和CusResponse类\n9.添加CusConvertHelper转换帮助类\n10.修改CusResponse类新增IsDebug字段\n11.新增HttpClientHelperV2类\n12.新增JuHeApiHelper帮助类\n13.显示注释\n14.ImportExportHelper修改\n15.新增RenameFilesHelper和VantPickerColumns类；更新包\n16.新增RenameFilesHelper.WriteToNotepad方法和重载方法\n17.修改HttpClientHelper类(V3)\n18.修改Md5工具类和修改DateHelper类\n19.新增CusHttpResponse类\n20.新增AES256CBCHelper类；更新JsonUtils工具类\n21.更新Directory.GetCurrentDirectory()\n22.ImportExportHelper修改(14)",
